    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there, Intern - Welcome to Coolmath Games! We're excited to have you join our team. Are you prepared for your first day? Don't worry, it'll be an easy one! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just introduce yourself to the team, help out on some quick tasks, and prepare for our daily game launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don't break anything along the way, okay?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fun and wacky story filled with loveable characters inspired by the real people at Coolmath Games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in choice-based conversations that show your true personality to the team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play fun puzzles that will take you out of the office and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick game parts that will affect the type of game that will be used for the game launch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot as many easter eggs as you can!</p></li></ul>",
